Name Buak_Note_21

Interactability_Text_Line_0 2012-11-25
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 We finally did it. We dropped the ball hard enough that the other chairmen have decided to unanimously consider the bioweapon contracts due to how many times we’ve accidentally made them. I really thought they were joking, but I was wrong. They said it’s for “funding future endeavours” and that “they will never be used”, but having things like that isn’t a good idea in the first place. I suppose once our research is complete it won’t even matter- but what if we aren’t fast enough? I’ll have to think up something soon, and delay it for as long as I can.